Z||000008||mshill||11-27-2000||01:51 PM||||Alex, are  you using the exhaust tips without a muffler?  I ask because I am building a 3.4 and want to do away with my stock exhaust system and use tips only if they are not extremely loud.  How do they compare to the stock exhaust system (tone wise)?||||reg||1
Z||000009||Alex4mula||11-27-2000||02:29 PM||||mshill; I have the Borla muffler with my new tips (Bonsal Brosspeed). I once had my 2.8 without cat & muffler using resonator tips. Performance was good but was way too loud. I wouldn't recommend it unless you really like loud exhaust. The sound note was very aggressive on that.||||reg||1
