Z||000012||Alex4mula||11-27-2000||04:09 PM||||Springs are from Fiero Store. Think they are 1" to 1.5" drop. Vette flooded & insurance had it in storage with original water inside for 10 months. I didn't provided clean title to them so they gave it to me & kept $500 they owed me. That's when I took out & cleaned the water inside 10 months later...<BR>Thanks all for the compliments.||||reg||1
